request.description:
WhatsApp as seen from inside one group, by the caller:

- `connected`, and `channel` - the business number, `keyword`, `delivery_enabled`, `replies_enabled`, and `join_link` (a `wa.me` link pre-filled with `START`: one tap to opt in);
- `is_admin`;
- `my_consent` - `null` (never asked), `pending`, `opted_in`, `declined` or `opted_out`;
- `my_number_verified` - opting in needs a verified phone; offer verification first when false.

Active members only; anyone else gets `404`.
